/****************************************************************
 * LEAD & INVESTOR TRACKER — Google Apps Script backend (Code.gs)
 *
 * Lives inside the Google Sheet that holds your data.
 *  1. In the sheet: Lead Tracker menu → Run setup (or run setup() here).
 *     Creates/updates the tabs, dropdowns, Access PIN and timers, and
 *     migrates data from the previous version (nothing is deleted except
 *     investor rows, which are MOVED from Leads to Investors).
 *  2. Deploy → New deployment → Web app
 *     (Execute as: Me, Who has access: Anyone). That URL is your link.
 *
 * Public visitors see only dashboard counts. Names, contact details,
 * money figures and editing need the Access PIN (Settings tab).
 ****************************************************************/

